{"parse": {"title": "WPK-02", "pageid": 59793, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/WPK-01\" title=\"WPK-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">WPK-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/WPK-03\" title=\"WPK-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">WPK</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.84.BF.E6.9C.9B.E9.97.AD.E7.8E.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"愿望闭环\">愿望闭环</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 愿望闭环</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Omnipotence Paradox</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>便<span class=\"color-value\"></span>携<span class=\"color-value\"></span>式<span class=\"color-value\"></span>计<span class=\"color-value\"></span>算<span class=\"color-value\"></span>机<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>格<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>条<span class=\"color-value\"></span>纹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>永<span class=\"color-value\"></span>远<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>保<span class=\"color-value\"></span>持<span class=\"color-value\"></span>敬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>畏<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>撮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191402</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光溜溜的脚丫跑过湖泊，跑过荒原，终于回到了更安宁的居所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>气球，棘刺，毛毯……它们在视野里消失，骄傲的小小胸膛又一次挺了起来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>总、总算跑出来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>她们到底在说些什么啊，让人一点儿也听不懂……恶作剧的难道不应该是我吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉拉泉冥思苦想，试图寻得一个合理的解释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>我明白了！一定是因为她们的年纪太小了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>唉，孩子们说话总让人难懂……这也是难免的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>泉水精灵的恶作剧应该朝着更高的目标努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她调整好心态，又开始好奇地打量着周遭的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>走廊里人来人往，漂浮的幽灵、跳脱的百合花、快步逃离的诗人与雀儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，他们算不上什么合适的目标。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">约翰·提托：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偶然经过的少女令她眼前一亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>那个女孩是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>唔……穿着很正常，身边没有跟着奇怪的魔精或是小鸟之类的……只是抱着一台普通的盒子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>嘻嘻，这才是理想的恶作剧对象嘛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她握紧拳头，跃跃欲试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>加油，拉拉泉，你一定能完成恶作剧，让所有人都大吃一惊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>约翰·提托仍在沉思之中，殊不知一项“伟大”的殊荣降临在她的头上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水雾喷薄，神秘的泉水精灵在一片朦胧中登场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>你好，被选中的幸运儿～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>伟大的泉水精灵即将实现你的愿望，心怀感激地接受这一切——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">约翰·提托：</div><div>486F776D616E79776973686573</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尚未说完的开场白戛然而止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>你在说……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">约翰·提托：</div><div>416E79636F6E646974696F6E73</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>预想之中的激动与溢美之词并未如愿到来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>你、你一点儿也不激动吗……？这个机会是多么难得啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">约翰·提托：</div><div>57686572656973796F75726C6F676963</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>……呃……我……你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>有人来……救命……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雾气迅速地散去了，可怜的孩子显然遭遇了沉重的打击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>值得庆幸的是，箱内总有热心帮忙的人，或机器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>你还好吗，拉拉泉小姐……？提托小姐是想问，有几个愿望、有什么限制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>一台……无线电收音机？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">约翰·提托：</div><div>4869</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>冒昧打扰，提托小姐，拉拉泉小姐。我正在为箱中厅堂择选适宜今日气候的音乐，无意中听到了你们的谈话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>很高兴能在这尤为重要的时刻聆听到如此亲切的机器语言——向你表示感谢，约翰·提托小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无线电小姐朝着约翰·提托的方位折了折天线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>机器……语言？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩童对晦涩的知识望而却步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>无需忧心，拉拉泉小姐，我能为你提供翻译……积极为箱中的朋友们建立适宜的联结，本就是我的责任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>提托小姐好奇的是，你能够为她实现几个愿望，它们会有什么限制吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉拉泉松了口气，一切似乎又回到了恶作剧的正轨上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>哼，真是个贪婪的家伙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>那么，伟大的泉水精灵告诉你，你得到了三个愿望，并且没有限制——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">约翰·提托：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>约翰·提托点了点头，靠近了无线电小姐的旋钮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她小声地嘟囔了一连串数字，绿色铁块的触须连连闪烁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>我明白了，那么提托小姐的第一个愿望是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>请以相反的形式实现第二个愿望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>第二个愿望是，请不要实现第三个愿望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>嗯嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>第三个愿望是，忽略我的第一个愿望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>第二个愿望做相反的……不要实现第三个愿望……忽略第一个愿望……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉拉泉的头上隐隐冒出了温泉的蒸汽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>这、是什么乱七八糟的愿望？这不是根本办不到吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>我……我、我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>不行！如果这样的话，我的恶作——我的愿望就根本没法实现了呀！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>约翰·提托只是笑了一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">约翰·提托：</div><div>4F66636F757273656E6F74</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">约翰·提托：</div><div>596F756172656E6F746177697368696E67656C66</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>等等——！你在说什么呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>约翰·提托离开了，拉拉泉的哭诉被远远地抛下了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>喂，绿花朵小姐，她到底是什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>翻译官的职责与维护友谊的使命强烈地相撞在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接连的打击堵塞了眼眶，四周的水雾愈发浓郁，连泪水也快要奔涌而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>噢，请不要哭泣，拉拉泉小姐……这对你我都不好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>我很乐意为你翻译。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弥漫的水雾不再扩散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>“拉拉泉小姐本来就不是许愿精灵，当然不可能实现愿望了……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>什……么……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水雾的温度迅速升高，厅堂似乎成了汹涌的温泉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div><b>太过分了——！</b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>我、我怎么可能实现不了愿望！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>我只是……只是不希望大家不劳而获罢了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>我一定会证明泉水精灵的能力！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "WPK-02"}}